cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this repository, please cite it. More importantly, cite the
  underlying dataset and models -- they are the substantive contributions.
  See references.bib.

title: panaf-ape-detection
abstract: >-
  Phase 1 ("See") research scaffold for detecting great apes in wild camera-trap
  video by running the pretrained MegaDetector V6 detector, via Microsoft
  PyTorch-Wildlife, over a small hand-selected sample of clips from the PanAf500
  subset of the PanAf20K dataset. No fine-tuning is performed. The detection,
  tracking and annotation pipeline is not implemented at this version; this
  release is the repository scaffold, typed configuration, setup CLI and locked
  environment.

type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-07-24"
repository-code: "https://github.com/adikothuri3/PanAF-Ape-Detection"

# Add collaborators by appending entries to this list. Order is authorship order.
